    "agent1-periodic-nine-center": {
      "scope": "For any nonempty period w and arbitrary center K, the original maximal center-strip function removes an added w/K/reverse-w wrapper, retains the same residual as stripping K, and increases the count by one. For bounded B,H and the actual mixed nine entry condition, the raw center is a nine wrapper around pair(fixedDigits H (leftEntry B) appended with rawGamma copies of 9*leftEntry B). The quotient center is that residual stripped center and its period count is the residual strip count plus one. Computed entries, clock and original executable fuel semantics are retained. No center descent, no-return obstruction, free carry assignment, qualifying cycle construction, unconditional decimal existence, or conclusion about196 is asserted.",
